132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 109 0 R
/T (Traditional CCTV surveillance is limited by human fatigue and high false-positive rates. Our project modernizes security by deploying a YOLOv11-based intelligent pipeline. By training on the Roboflow Weapon Detection Dataset, we enable real-time, high-precision threat identification. Through motion-gated inference and temporal buffering, our system autonomously filters environmental noise, extracting high-fidelity data for actionable threat intelligence. This approach drastically minimizes the cognitive burden on human operators while ensuring rapid, reliable response times in critical scenarios. Ultimately, the system provides a robust, scalable framework designed for seamless integration into existing security infrastructure.)
/E (Traditional CCTV surveillance is limited by human fatigue and high false-positive rates. Our project modernizes security by deploying a YOLOv11-based intelligent pipeline. By training on the Roboflow Weapon Detection Dataset, we enable real-time, high-precision threat identification. Through motion-gated inference and temporal buffering, our system autonomously filters environmental noise, extracting high-fidelity data for actionable threat intelligence. This approach drastically minimizes the cognitive burden on human operators while ensuring rapid, reliable response times in critical scenarios. Ultimately, the system provides a robust, scalable framework designed for seamless integration into existing security infrastructure.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
