164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 115 0 R
/T (Existing CCTV-based threat detection systems mainly focus on object detection and may not perform well in real-world conditions. Challenges such as poor lighting, blur, occlusion, unnecessary frame processing, and unstable detections can reduce accuracy and increase false alerts. Most existing approaches also lack a unified method for motion-based processing, image enhancement, temporal filtering, and ROI extraction. Therefore, there is a need for a lightweight and reliable real-time surveillance system that can handle these challenges and provide accurate threat detection with faster alerts.)
/E (Existing CCTV-based threat detection systems mainly focus on object detection and may not perform well in real-world conditions. Challenges such as poor lighting, blur, occlusion, unnecessary frame processing, and unstable detections can reduce accuracy and increase false alerts. Most existing approaches also lack a unified method for motion-based processing, image enhancement, temporal filtering, and ROI extraction. Therefore, there is a need for a lightweight and reliable real-time surveillance system that can handle these challenges and provide accurate threat detection with faster alerts.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
