346 0 obj
<<
/Title (In conclusion, this project presents a reliable and intelligent approach to modern security surveillance. By integrating YOLOv11-based weapon detection with motion-gated inference, low-light image enhancement, and temporal buffering, the system accurately identifies verified threats while reducing false alarms caused by environmental noise. This enables security personnel to focus on critical events, respond more quickly, and make better-informed decisions. With its scalable architecture and compatibility with existing CCTV infrastructure, the proposed system offers a practical step toward safer, smarter, and more efficient public-security monitoring.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 187 0 R
>>
