561 0 obj
<<
/Title (Existing CCTV-based threat detection systems mainly focus on object detection and may not perform well in real-world conditions. Challenges such as poor lighting, blur, occlusion, unnecessary frame processing, and unstable detections can reduce accuracy and increase false alerts. Most existing approaches also lack a unified method for motion-based processing, image enhancement, temporal filtering, and ROI extraction. Therefore, there is a need for a lightweight and reliable real-time surveillance system that can handle these challenges and provide accurate threat detection with faster alerts.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 506 0 R
>>
endobj
